//00 hbtdata / Data from the Canary Islands
Data explained with things from here.
I'm Henry Barrios Thornhill, a data analyst in Gran Canaria, in the Canary Islands. I build my own tools with public data and show how they are made.
Enter
//01 The Canary Islands in data
Seven islands. Lots of data.
Fuel, football, local history and football pools. Data from the islands that people here actually share, told so it makes sense at first glance.
//02 Project / Canarias Gas Tracker
The cheapest fuel on the islands.
Each dot is a real petrol station, from turquoise (cheapest) to ochre (most expensive). Prices come every day from the Spanish government's public API, and GitHub Actions updates the site on its own.
Unleaded 95 / prices on 13 Oct 2026 / Spanish government
